      "caption": "🤝🏻𝗛𝗶𝗴𝗵𝗹𝗶𝗴𝗵𝘁𝗶𝗻𝗴 𝗧𝗵𝗲 𝗖𝗼𝗺𝗽𝗮𝗻𝗶𝗼𝗻𝘀 𝗿.𝗮. (English Talk)\n\nJoin Ustazah Hidayah Azman as we uncover the lesser-known stories of the Companions r.a. and discover timeless lessons from those who stood beside the Prophet s.a.w.\n\n📅 Friday, 25 September 2026\n🕰️ After Maghrib Prayers - 8.07 PM\n📍 MPH Level 3, Masjid An-Nahdhah\n\nCome, learn their stories. Reflect on their sacrifices. And discover what their legacy means for us today. \n\nMuslimin & Muslimah are all welcome!"
